title: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> checks upon our progress in accomplishing the coalition's goals...
view-if: (in_popular_front or in_left_front) and (collectivist_ultimatum_timer = 0 or (welfare_goal_completed and agriculture_goal_completed and economy_goal_completed and finance_goal_completed and labor_goal_completed and army_goal_completed)) and collectivist_goals_seen = 1 and collectivist_ultimatum_seen = 0 and marcher_in_government
on-arrival: {!
Q.collectivist_ultimatum_seen = 1;
Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 1;
Q.collectivist_score = 6;
if (Q.welfare_goal && !Q.welfare_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.collectivist_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.agriculture_goal && !Q.agriculture_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.collectivist_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.economy_goal && !Q.economy_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.collectivist_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.finance_goal && !Q.finance_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.collectivist_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.labor_goal && !Q.labor_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.collectivist_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.foreign_goal && !Q.foreign_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.collectivist_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.interior_goal && !Q.interior_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
}
if (Q.army_goal && !Q.army_goal_completed) {
    Q.collectivist_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.collectivist_score -= 1;
}
!}
new-page: true
tags: event
go-to: goals_success if collectivist_goals_completed; goals_failed if not collectivist_goals_completed

= <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> Goals

At the start of this government, the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> presented a list of goals for the coalition:

[? if welfare_goal = 1 : - Expand social welfare programs - [? if welfare_goal_completed : success ?][? if not welfare_goal_completed: failed ?] ?]

[? if agriculture_goal = 1 : - Enact a land reform program. - [? if agriculture_goal_completed : success ?][? if not agriculture_goal_completed: failed ?] ?]

[? if economy_goal = 1 : - Start substantial nationalization of the economy. - [? if economy_goal_completed : success ?][? if not economy_goal_completed: failed ?] ?]

[? if finance_goal = 1 : - Make taxes more progressive. - [? if finance_goal_completed : success ?][? if not finance_goal_completed: failed ?] ?]

[? if labor_goal = 1 : - Support workers in labor disputes. - [? if labor_goal_completed : success ?][? if not labor_goal_completed: failed ?] ?]

[? if foreign_goal = 1 : - Improve our relations with the <span style="color: #750e0e;">Central Union</span>. - [? if foreign_goal_completed : success ?][? if not foreign_goal_completed: failed ?] ?]

[? if army_goal = 1 : - Reduce funding for the Commonwealth Army. - [? if army_goal_completed : success ?][? if not army_goal_completed: failed ?] ?]

@goals_failed
on-arrival: collectivist_relation -= 10; commons_marcher -= 8; disfavored_marcher -= 8;

Unfortunately, we have failed to accomplish all of the goals the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> set out. They plan to call a vote of no confidence against our government, and have already begun mounting a propaganda campaign to delegitimize our government in the eyes of the workers.

- @appeal: Appeal to the <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivists</span> to have patience - we are trying!
- @kpd_vote_of_no_confidence.support_center: Could we form a new government based on the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist: (and possibly <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?]?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]?
- @kpd_vote_of_no_confidence.let_it_happen: Let the vote happen.
- @no_vonc: They cannot call a vote of no confidence due to the constitutional reforms, but they can obstruct our government at every opportunity.
- @spd_majority: We have a majority without them.

@appeal
choose-if: (collectivist_score >= 4 and collectivist_relation > 50 and collectivist_appeal_seen = 0) or collectivist_leader = "Conciliators"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if collectivist_score < 4: They do not see us as serious in trying to achieve the goals of the coalition. ?] [? if collectivist_relation < 50: Our relations are too poor. ?] [? if collectivist_appeal_seen = 1: we do not have any more time. ?]
on-arrival: collectivist_ultimatum_seen = 0; collectivist_ultimatum_timer += 6; collectivist_appeal_seen = 1

We argue that we are working hard to achieve the coalition's goals, and in the name of proletarian solidarity, we must make this coalition function. Surprisingly, the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> hears our pleas, and is willing to give us six more months before the coalition goals must be achieved.


@goals_success
on-arrival: commons_marcher += 8; disfavored_marcher += 8; collectivist_relation += 10; commons_collectivist += 5; collectivist_coalition_success += 1
go-to: popular_front_achievement if in_popular_front; united_front_achievement if in_left_front

Against all expectations, the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>'s goals have all been met! Apparently the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> did not prepare for this eventuality, a worker's government successfully built through democratic means. They will continue to "tolerate" our government for the rest of our term, while still acting as a watchdog against propertied backsliding.


@popular_front_achievement
on-arrival: popular_front_success += 1
achievement: volksfront_2

@united_front_achievement
on-arrival: united_front_success += 1
achievement: einheitsfront_2

@no_vonc
view-if: constructive_vonc
on-arrival: in_popular_front = 0; in_left_front = 0; in_minority_government = 1;

We have been effectively made a minority government, and the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> intends to obstruct our attempts to pass policy.

@spd_majority
view-if: marcher_r >= 50
on-arrival: in_popular_front = 0; in_left_front = 0; in_marcher_majority = 1;

We were so kind.